{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50325","headline":"非所寄王都护姨夫 · 佚名","name":"非所寄王都护姨夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敦煌数度访来人，握手千回问懿亲。\n蓬转已闻过海畔，莎居见说傍河津。\n戎庭事事皆违意，虏口朝朝计苦辛。\n缧绁傥逢恩降日，宿心言豁（原作「豁」）在他辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}